{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/SteamGIF_01.gif?t=1745145675\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>TWIN FLAMES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique turn-based puzzle adventure where love and strategy collide. Control Savitri and Satyavan\u2014two halves of a destined whole\u2014as they navigate a hex-grid world, overcoming obstacles and forging an unbreakable bond. This is their 27th attempt to achieve the Twin Flame state. Will they finally succeed, or fall short once more? Their fate rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/SteamGIF_02.gif?t=1745145675\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Hex-Grid Play</strong>: Plan every move, clear paths, and outsmart intricate puzzles together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Twin Flame Journey</strong>: Feel the pull of a profound connection as Savitri and Satyavan strive for unity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local Co-op Mode</strong>: Team up with a friend for a shared adventure that tests your synergy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stylized Low Poly Art</strong>: Explore a breathtaking world crafted in vibrant, minimalist style. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084560/extras/SteamGIF_03.gif?t=1745145675\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Join Savitri and Satyavan on their quest to become Twin Flames. Explore, strategize, and connect in this captivating puzzle adventu